Triplets -- Betti diagrams and hypercohomology tables associated to triplets of degree sequences
************************************************************************************************

Description
===========

Triplets is a package to calculate


1) Betti diagrams of triplets of pure free squarefree complexes, as introduced
in math.AC/1207.2071 "Triplets of pure free squarefree complexes"


 2) hypercohomology tables associated to homology triplets, as given in
math.AC/1212.3675 "Zipping Tate resolutions and exterior coalgebras"


by Gunnar Floeystad.


Degree sequences
================

  * *note strands: strands_lpList_rp, -- strand span of degree sequence
  * *note strandsL: strandsL_lpZZ_cmList_rp, -- strand span as a subset of
    [0,n]
  * *note conj: conj_lpList_cmZZ_rp, -- conjugate of degree sequence

Degree triplets and homology triplets
=====================================

  * *note triplet: triplet_lpList_cmList_cmList_rp, -- make a triplet
  * *note rotForw: rotForw_lpTriplet_rp, -- forward cyclic permutation
  * *note rotBack: rotBack_lpTriplet_rp, -- backward cyclic permutation
  * *note toHomology: toHomology_lpTriplet_rp, -- from degree triplet to
    homology triplet
  * *note toDegree: toDegree_lpTriplet_rp, -- from homology triplet to degree
    triplet
  * *note dualHomTriplet: dualHomTriplet_lpTriplet_rp, -- the dual homology
    triplet
  * *note type: type_lpTriplet_rp, -- number of variables

Checking triplets
=================

  * *note isDegreeTriplet: isDegreeTriplet_lpTriplet_rp, -- checks if it is a
    degree triplet
  * *note isHomologyTriplet: isHomologyTriplet_lpTriplet_rp, -- checks if it is
    a homology triplet

