==============

  * *note Betti1: Betti1_lpTriplet_rp, -- Betti numbers of first pure complex
  * *note Betti3: Betti3_lpTriplet_rp, -- Betti numbers of the three pure
    complexes
  * *note BettiDiagram1: BettiDiagram1_lpTriplet_rp, -- Betti diagram of first
    pure complex
  * *note BettiDiagram3: BettiDiagram3_lpTriplet_rp, -- Betti diagrams of the
    three pure complexes

Polynomials
===========

  * *note binPol: binPol_lpRingElement_cmZZ_cmZZ_rp, -- product of two binomial
    polynomials
  * *note hilbCoeff: hilbCoeff_lpTriplet_rp, -- coefficients of Hilbert
    polynomial
  * *note hilbPol: hilbPol_lpRingElement_cmZZ_cmList_cmList_rp, -- Hilbert
    polynomial
  * *note chiPol: chiPol_lpRingElement_cmZZ_cmList_cmList_rp, -- Hilbert
