Betti1(Triplet) -- Betti numbers of first pure complex
******************************************************

  * Function: *note Betti1: Betti1_lpTriplet_rp,
  * Usage: 
        Betti1 T
  * Inputs:
      * T, an instance of the type *note Triplet: Triplet,, a degree triplet
  * Outputs:
      * a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, the Betti numbers

Description
===========

The Betti numbers of the first complex in the triplet of pure complexes with
the three given degree sequences.
+-----------------------------------------+
|i1 : T = triplet({1,2,3}, {0,2}, {0,2,3})|
|                                         |
|o1 = {{1, 2, 3}, {0, 2}, {0, 2, 3}}      |
|                                         |
|o1 : Triplet                             |
+-----------------------------------------+
|i2 : Betti1(T)                           |
|                                         |
|o2 = {3, 6, 2}                           |
|                                         |
|o2 : List                                |
+-----------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note Betti3: Betti3_lpTriplet_rp, -- Betti numbers of the three pure
    complexes
  * *note BettiDiagram1: BettiDiagram1_lpTriplet_rp, -- Betti diagram of first
    pure complex

Ways to use this method:
========================

  * *note Betti1(Triplet): Betti1_lpTriplet_rp, -- Betti numbers of first pure
